{"text": "On a sunny afternoon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima flew to the wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For the last time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The gentleman was sitting on a log. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he looked nervous. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Look at your eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And then give me the herbs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Be quick. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He spoke more sharply than before and Jemima felt surprised and uncomfortable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While Jemima was inside the shed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Someone with a black nose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Locked the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After terrible barking and howling. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody ever saw. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The foxy whiskered gentleman again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Kep opened the door of the shed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And let Jemima out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sadly the puppies rushed in and ate up all the eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Before Kep could stop them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima went home in tears. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because her eggs were gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In June she laid some more eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And this time she could keep them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But only four of them hatched. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And Jemima said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was because of her nerves.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", " ", "a", " ", "s", "u", "n", "n", "y", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", "n", "o", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "f", "l", "e", "w", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i